    "description": "<table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:2em; border:2px solid #999; font-size:105%; text-align:center; background:#00008B;\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <td><i><b>This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a> has been <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Tested\" title=\"Category:Tested\">Tested</a> per the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Untested\" title=\"Category:Untested\">Untested</a> guidelines. Whether or not it can be used is, as always, the prerogative of the Gamemaster.</b></i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p><i>Homebrew Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Clone_Wars_Saga_Edition_Fan_Sourcebook\" title=\"Clone Wars Saga Edition Fan Sourcebook\">Clone Wars Saga Edition Fan Sourcebook</a> - Bounty Hunters &amp; Mercenaries (Part 1)</i> </p><p>An insulated glove with an embedded energy cell, the Ionizing Gauntlet produces as electrifying charge when it strikes an electronic target. An Ionizing Gauntlet changes the wearer’s <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed\">Unarmed</a> melee attacks to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ion_Damage\" title=\"Ion Damage\">Ion Damage</a>, and they provide a +1 bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ion_Damage\" title=\"Ion Damage\">Ion Damage</a> on a successful <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed\">Unarmed</a> attack. </p><p>Ionizing Gauntlets are two sizes smaller than their wearer (for example, an Ionizing Gauntlet designed for a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a> are Tiny). Because of how they are worn, Ionizing Gauntlets cannot be <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Disarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disarmed\">Disarmed</a> or dropped. </p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Small_Ionizing_Gauntlets\">Small Ionizing Gauntlets</span></h3><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Medium_Ionizing_Gauntlets\">Medium Ionizing Gauntlets</span></h3>",
